{"_id":"spv0001","name":"Boundless Sight","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"See/hear familiar location up to 50 miles away. Trance state (Armor TN = 5). 4 rounds. [CR p.197]","specialRules":"The most essential lesson of the ishiken is that all is linked through the Void, and through the Void all can be perceived. By focusing your energy, you can look through the veil and see another location as if you were standing there. This location must be familiar to you, and you must have been there at least once before. For the duration of the spell, you can see and hear all that transpires in the other location, but you may not be detected and you may not interact with things or individuals there in any way. During this spell, your body is in a trance-like state that leaves you highly vulnerable to attack (your Armor TN is reduced to 5).","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":1,"keywords":[],"range":"50 miles","aoe":"Self","duration":"4 rounds","raises":"Duration (+1 round), Range (+5 miles)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0002","name":"Drawing The Void","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Gain Void Points = School Rank + 1. Excess points lost if not spent each round. [CR p.197]","specialRules":"The ability to reach into the Void itself and gain strength from it is a vital lesson in the training of all ishiken. Upon completion of this spell, you gain a number of additional Void Points equal to your School Rank plus one. If these Void Points take you above the number you may normally possess, then you lose one of the extra Void Points every Round that you do not spend one.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":1,"keywords":[],"range":"Personal","aoe":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Special (+1 Void Point gained per three Raises)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0003","name":"Flow Through The Void","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Transform 1 cubic foot pure elemental matter into another element. Permanent. [CR p.197]","specialRules":"In the Void, all things are equal, all one and none. By tapping into this connection, you may transform a small amount of pure elemental matter - water, fire, air, or earth in the form of dirt or soil - into any one other element.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":1,"keywords":[],"range":"Touch","aoe":"Up to one cubic foot of pure elemental matter","duration":"Permanent","raises":"Area (+1 cubic foot)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0004","name":"See Through Lies","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Learn target's highest-point Advantage or Disadvantage (your choice). [CR p.197]","specialRules":"The patterns that comprise all things in the Void exist in individuals as well, and with training, ishiken can recognize them. You learn the highest point Advantage or highest point Disadvantage (your choice) possessed by the target of this spell.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":1,"keywords":[],"range":"25'","aoe":"Target individual","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Range (+5'), Special (one additional Advantage/Disadvantage per Raise)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0005","name":"Sense Void","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Detect all living creatures in 25' radius. Spirits/Shadowlands appear as gaps. Concentration. [CR p.197]","specialRules":"Life is evident in the Void like the stars in the night sky. This spell causes you to enter a trance during which you become aware of the existence and location of all living creatures within the radius of the spell. Although you are aware of their location, you cannot see them or any details. You would know if there were three humans waiting outside the castle wall, for instance, but you would not recognize them other than to know that they were present. This also gives you information regarding non-sentient, natural living creatures. Spirits and Shadowlands creatures are recognizable as a gap in your awareness, although this spell cannot recognize Tainted humans as anything other than humans.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":1,"keywords":[],"range":"Personal","aoe":"25' radius around the caster","duration":"Concentration","raises":"Area (+5' radius)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0006","name":"Touch The Emptiness","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Target suffers 1k1 Wounds and Dazed condition. [CR p.197]","specialRules":"The sensation of experiencing the Void firsthand can be extremely disturbing for those unaccustomed to it. The target of this spell suffers 1k1 damage and is Dazed.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":1,"keywords":[],"range":"30'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Range (+5')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":600000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0007","name":"The Void's Caress","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Negate one Mental/Spiritual Disadvantage (max 5 points) for 1 minute. [CR p.197]","specialRules":"Although beginning students of ishiken-do cannot affect the pattern of the Void, they can make very short-term alterations to it. You may negate any one Mental or Spiritual Disadvantage the target of this spell possesses, up to a maximum of 5 points in value. The Shadowlands Taint may not be removed via this spell, although the mental disorders that can be caused by it can be temporarily alleviated.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":1,"keywords":[],"range":"Touch","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"1 minute","raises":"Duration (+1 minute)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0008","name":"Witness The Untold","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Interrupt target's declared action before execution while delaying. 3 rounds. [CR p.197]","specialRules":"It is possible to gain fleeting glimpses of things that have not yet happened by peering through the Void. If you are delaying your action, you may interrupt the target of this spell after he has declared his action but before he has taken his action when his Turn comes up. This may be done during each Round for the duration of the spell. (Normally someone delaying their Action cannot interrupt the Action of another participant.)","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":1,"keywords":["Divination"],"range":"15'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"3 rounds","raises":"Range (+5')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":800000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0009","name":"Altering The Course","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Spend multiple Void Points on single roll (where normally allowed). 1 minute. [CR p.199]","specialRules":"Ishiken have a much greater capacity to draw upon the Void than others, and may do it consciously rather than unconsciously. You may spend multiple Void Points on any roll made within the duration of this spell. It still must be a roll on which the expenditure of Void Points is allowable (no damage rolls may be augmented via this spell, for example).","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":2,"keywords":[],"range":"Personal","aoe":"Self","duration":"1 minute","raises":"Duration (+1 minute)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":900000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0010","name":"Drink Of Your Essence","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Learn target's Rings, current Wound penalties, and one-word mood summary. [CR p.199]","specialRules":"As an ishiken grows more powerful, he can gain more information from examining an individual's pattern within the Void. You learn a great deal of information about the target of this spell, including his individual Rings (but not Traits), his current Wound penalties, and a one word summation of his present mood (\"hostile,\" \"sorrowful,\" \"confused,\" etc.).","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":2,"keywords":[],"range":"30'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Range (+5')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1000000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0011","name":"The Empty Voice","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Cast spells (Mastery ≤2) silently without speaking prayers. 5 minutes. [CR p.199]","specialRules":"Drawing on the essence of everything allows an ishiken to invoke the kami with far greater ease than normal. For the duration of this spell, you may cast spells of other elements without speaking your prayers aloud. This applies only to spells of equal or lower Mastery Level (any spell of Mastery Level 1 or 2).","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":2,"keywords":[],"range":"Personal","aoe":"Self","duration":"5 minutes","raises":"None","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0012","name":"False Whispers","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Target repeats your next sentence verbatim in their own voice. Once per casting. 1 minute. [CR p.199]","specialRules":"Mingling the Void of two beings, even for just a moment, can lead to one of the two being manipulated if he is not prepared for it. The target of this spell will repeat the next sentence you say, verbatim, without any foreknowledge of what he is doing. They speak the words in their own normal voice, regardless of how you speak it. This effect will not allow others to cast spells, even if you have them recite a portion of a spell. This spell only allows the effect once, the first time you speak a single sentence during the duration of the spell.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":2,"keywords":[],"range":"30'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"1 minute","raises":"None","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0013","name":"Reach Through The Void","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Telekinetically move object up to 5 pounds within 50'. [CR p.199]","specialRules":"All things, both living and unliving, exist within the Void, and can be touched through it. You can manipulate items through the Void, moving them without touching them. These items are small, usually only up to five pounds, although a powerful shugenja can Raise enough to move somewhat heavier items.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":2,"keywords":[],"range":"50'","aoe":"Target object, up to five pounds in weight","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Area (+1 pound per two Raises), Range (+5')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0014","name":"Severed From The Stream","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Target must win Contested Void vs you to spend Void Points. 5 rounds. [CR p.199]","specialRules":"Talented ishiken can rob others of their ability to tap into the Void, if only temporarily. If this spell is successful, the target must succeed at a Contested Void Roll against you before they are able to spend any Void Points. This roll does not count as an action for the target, and they must succeed at only one Contested Roll per turn, even if they are spending multiple Void Points per turn as a result of a Technique or other ability.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":2,"keywords":[],"range":"25'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"5 rounds","raises":"Duration (+1 round), Range (+5')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0015","name":"Echoes In The Void","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Hear target's thoughts while concentrating. Manifestation varies by individual. Concentration. [CR p.201]","specialRules":"Thoughts are as whispers in the Void, if one knows how to listen. As long as this spell is in effect and you maintain concentration on one target within the area of effect, you can hear what that person is thinking. How this manifests may vary depending upon the individual. Stalwart warriors may have short, curt statements summarizing their thoughts, while artisans may think in terms of poetry.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":3,"keywords":[],"range":"25'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"Concentration","raises":"Range (+5')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0016","name":"Kharmic Intent","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Share Void Point pool with willing target. Points divided at end. 10 minutes. [CR p.201]","specialRules":"Links forged of the Void allow the passage of enormous energy, the substance of the universe itself, between those who share it. You may target any one willing individual with this spell. All remaining Void Points either of you possess are placed in a single pool, which either of you may draw upon as normal. Essentially, this spell allows two individuals to share Void Points back and forth as they see fit. This also allows ishiken to share the additional Void Points they gain from other Void spells. At the end of the spell's Duration, all remaining Void Points are divided between the participants, up to their normal maximum number.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":3,"keywords":[],"range":"20'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"10 minutes","raises":"Duration (+1 minute), Range (+5')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1600000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0017","name":"Moment Of Clarity","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Gain temporary ranks in one Skill = Void Ring (replaces existing ranks). 2 rounds. [CR p.201]","specialRules":"The entirety of human achievement is reflected in the Void. You may select any one Skill. You gain temporary ranks in this Skill equal to your Void Ring. If you already posses ranks in this Skill, the new level of Skill replaces your old one; the two are not cumulative.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":3,"keywords":[],"range":"Personal","aoe":"Self","duration":"2 rounds","raises":"Duration (+1 round)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0018","name":"Read The Essence","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Meditate on object to see last holder or major event involving it. Instantaneous vision. [CR p.201]","specialRules":"Even objects have resonance, and retain some memory of those who hold them, and events that take place involving them. By meditating upon an object, you can gain a vision of the individual who held it last, or of a major event that might have involved it in some manner. Using this spell on a calligraphy brush, for example, might show the last person who used it to write a letter. Using it on a weapon might instead show the last death it was used to inflict. The GM has ultimate authority over what vision the spell imparts. Extremely important objects, such as ancestral weapons or standards, may have powerful visions that grip the caster for longer periods of time, rather than imparting simple instantaneous visions.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":3,"keywords":["Divination"],"range":"Personal","aoe":"One target object","duration":"Instantaneous (but see below)","raises":"None","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1800000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0019","name":"Void Release","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Contested Void: steal 1+ Void Points from target, gain them temporarily (1 hour). [CR p.201]","specialRules":"Most are ignorant of the Void coursing within them, and do not realize that it can be stolen away. You must make a Contested Void Roll against the target of this spell. If successful, the target loses one Void Point, and you gain one Void Point. An additional point is exchanged for every increment of 5 by which you exceed the target's roll. These temporary Void Points may take you above the maximum number of Void Points you may have, but they expire within one hour if not used. This spell cannot be used on a creature who does not have Void Points, or which has some other mechanical effect that substitutes for Void (such as Naga Akasha or Ratling Name).","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":3,"keywords":[],"range":"25'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Range (+5')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":1900000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0020","name":"Balance Of Elements","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Negate all Disadvantages and spell penalties (Mastery ≤3). Heal 3k3 Wounds. 5 rounds/5 minutes. [CR p.203]","specialRules":"Flaws in the great pattern of the Void can be overcome, no matter how severe. You may negate all Disadvantages of the target for the duration of the spell. Negative effects inflicted from spells (such as TN penalties, Armor TN reduction, or Trait/Ring reduction) are negated as well, as long as the Mastery Level of the spell causing the penalty is 3 or less. If used during the taxing environment of combat, the duration of this spell is extremely limited (5 rounds). In non-combat situations, however, the effects of the spell can last significantly longer (5 minutes). This temporary replenishing of the target's pattern also heals 3k3 Wounds.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":4,"keywords":[],"range":"Touch","aoe":"One target individual (may be the caster)","duration":"5 rounds / 5 minutes (see below)","raises":"Duration (+1 round /+1 minute, see below), Special (+1k1 Wounds per two Raises)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2000000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0021","name":"Draw Closed The Veil","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Banish spirit to home realm for Void Ring months. Contested Willpower for embodied spirits. [CR p.203]","specialRules":"The emptiness that is the Void is part and parcel of what separates the various spirit realms from one another, and it is possible to strengthen it in certain areas. You may target any one spirit not native to the mortal realm of Ningen-do. That spirit is banished to its home realm for a minimum amount of time equal to your Void Ring in months. Spirits that possess a physical body in the mortal realm, such as oni or certain shapeshifter spirits, require a Contested Willpower Roll for this spell to affect them. Spirits that are significantly more powerful than you are (GM's discretion) may prove immune to the effects of this spell.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":4,"keywords":[],"range":"50'","aoe":"One target spirit","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Range (+5'), Targets (+1 spirit per Raise)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0022","name":"Fill With Emptiness","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Target regains all Void Points up to maximum. [CR p.203]","specialRules":"Strengthening an individual's connection to the Void can replenish their reserves of inner energy. The target of this spell regains all lost Void Points, up to their normal maximum number.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":4,"keywords":[],"range":"Touch","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Range (may be increased to 10' with three Raises)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0023","name":"Void Strike","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"DR = Void Ring. Direct Void damage. [CR p.203]","specialRules":"The mortal shell can endure only so much direct contact with the Void; too much, and the flesh can be destroyed by the exposure. This spell inflicts damage with a DR equal to your Void Ring.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":4,"keywords":[],"range":"50'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Range (+5'), Special (+1k0 damage per two Raises)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0024","name":"Divide The Soul","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Exist in two places simultaneously. Both act independently. Wounds/death affect both. 1 minute. [CR p.205]","specialRules":"The true mysteries of the Void are beyond the comprehension of non-ishiken. Using this spell, you may divide your soul across the Void, and exist in two places in the mortal realm simultaneously. The second \"you\" appears anywhere you might wish within your sight when you cast the spell. You have full knowledge of all that happens in both locations, and may take any normal actions in either place (both manifestations may take actions simultaneously as if they were two separate individuals). Only one manifestation may make a Spell Casting Roll per round. Any Wounds suffered by either manifestation are combined when the spell ends, and if either of your selves dies, both die.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":5,"keywords":[],"range":"Personal","aoe":"Self","duration":"1 minute","raises":"Duration (+1 minute)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0025","name":"Reforge","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Transform one uniform object into another of comparable size. Permanent (reversible). [CR p.205]","specialRules":"All is one and one is all. You may take any single object and transform it into any other object of comparable size. This will only work on an object that is uniform in its construction, rather than assembled from multiple pieces. This spell will not affect living material. Although the effect of this spell is permanent, it can be reversed by a second casting on the same object, even by a different ishiken.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":5,"keywords":[],"range":"Touch","aoe":"One object","duration":"Permanent","raises":"None","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0026","name":"Unbound Essence","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Randomly reorder target's Rings and Traits. 1 hour. [CR p.205]","specialRules":"Tampering with the pattern of another being's Void can result in catastrophic changes to their abilities. The target's Rings are reordered at random, along with their Traits. For instance, a target might exchange his Air Ring for his Fire Ring, and his Water Ring for his Earth Ring for the duration of this spell. Mental and Physical Traits exchange their values if those values are greater than the Ring. In the above example, if your target has Air 3 and Reflexes 4, he would instead have Fire 3 and Agility 4, with his values for those Traits reassigned to his Air and Reflexes.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":5,"keywords":[],"range":"25'","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"1 hour","raises":"Duration (+1 hour), Range (+5')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2600000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0027","name":"Ring Of The Void","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Commune with Void Dragon (1-hour ritual). Ask questions. Disrespect = cease to exist. Concentration. [CR p.207]","specialRules":"Rare and extraordinarily powerful, even by shugenja standards, this prayer calls on the unique favor of the dragon whose domain the ishiken tread: the Void Dragon. Unlike most spells, this is not something that is taught by others, but rather is simply learned through insight by those capable of casting it (and as such it has no scroll associated with it). This spell, more of a meditation ritual, actually allows you to commune with the Void Dragon itself, a feat few mortals have ever managed to perform successfully. During your brief moments of contact with this divine entity, you may ask it questions as you see fit. The Void Dragon knows all that can be known, although it is under no particular compulsion to answer you directly, or even at all. Respect must be maintained at all times, for those who have attempted this feat in the past and failed to pay homage to their patron have ceased to exist altogether.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":6,"keywords":[],"range":"Personal","aoe":"Self","duration":"Concentration (requires one hour to cast)","raises":"Duration (-5 minutes to casting time)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0028","name":"Rise From The Ashes","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Restore target to state 8 hours prior (1-hour ritual). Lose all Void Points for 3+ days. Cannot revive dead. [CR p.207]","specialRules":"Everything that exists has a pattern in the Void, a thread woven in the tapestry that is existence. By recalling the memory of that pattern, you can reverse recent effects that have happened to a living creature. When you cast this spell on an individual, you are essentially restoring their existence within the Void in accordance with their previous self. Upon completion of the spell, the person is immediately restored to the state they were in eight hours prior to when the spell was begun. Any injuries suffered during this time, the effects of diseases or poisons, even the acquisition of supernatural conditions such as the Shadowlands Taint or corruption by the Lying Darkness, can be undone in this manner. Upon the completion of this spell, you lose all Void Points, and you may not regain Void Points for a period of three days, after which they will begin to recover at one Void Point per day until you have your maximum normal amount again.\nThis spell cannot be used to restore someone who has died.","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":6,"keywords":[],"range":"Touch","aoe":"One target individual","duration":"Instantaneous (requires one hour to cast)","raises":"Special (+1 hour of regression per Raise)","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2800000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"spv0029","name":"Unmake The World","type":"spell","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/void.webp","system":{"description":"Contested Void vs Earth: target killed, remains vanish. Auto-success vs non-magical objects. [CR p.207]","specialRules":"The most powerful and terrifying ability of those who command the Void is the ability to destroy the bonds that exist between the five elements. By eradicating the bonds between existing elements, you can effectively cause one object or creature to cease to exist. When you cast this spell on a living creature, you must succeed at a Contested Roll using your Void against the target's Earth. If you are successful, they are instantly killed, and their remains disappear into the Void. Success is automatic against a non-magical object, but attempting to destroy an awakened object, such as a nemuranai, may have dire ramifications at the GM's discretion (the kami contained within an awakened object frequently respond very poorly to this manner of attack, for instance).","freeRaises":0,"ring":"void","mastery":6,"keywords":[],"range":"50'","aoe":"One target creature, individual, or object","duration":"Instantaneous","raises":"Range (+10')","memorized":false},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Spells/Void","sort":2900000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
